sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant F as Frontend (proxy)
  participant G as Gateway
  participant M as Model server (MLflow)
  participant R as MLflow registry
  U->>F: Paste plot, click "Find genres"
  F->>G: POST /api/v1/predict (X-API-Key)
  G->>G: validate text, start timer
  G->>M: POST /invocations {dataframe_records, params}
  M-->>G: genres + keywords (JSON columns)
  G->>R: champion version (cached 30 s)
  G->>G: metrics, live drift window
  G-->>F: PredictResponse
  F-->>U: chips, confidence bars, highlighted words
